          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.069,
            0.488,
            0.086
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ganita Manjari | Grade 9 | Part I"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.108,
            0.885,
            0.148
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since π is irrational, there is no ‘best fraction’ for π. If there is any fraction that is close to π, we can find another fraction that is closer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.151,
            0.885,
            0.27
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The well-known fraction "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 2 2 } { 7 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is good enough for most practical uses. But it is important to note that π is not equal to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 2 2 } { 7 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (they are ‘close but not equal’). So we write "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\pi \\approx { \\frac { 2 2 } { 7 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and also "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\pi   \\neq   \\frac { 2 2 } { 7 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . In the same way, we can write "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\sqrt { 2 } }   \\approx 1 . 4 1 4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and also "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\sqrt { 2 } }   \\neq 1 . 4 1 4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.27,
            0.801,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As noted earlier, a much better approximation for π is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 3 5 5 } { 1 1 3 } } ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.186,
            0.315,
            0.813,
            0.612
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.315,
                0.813,
                0.612
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_6_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.633,
            0.231,
            0.652
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fun Fact"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.661,
            0.738,
            0.711
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here’s a fun way to remember the first few digits of π: How I wish I could recollect "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "p i ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.719,
            0.883,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Count the number of letters in each word (3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2) and you get the digits of π! So, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\pi \\approx 3 . 1 4 1 5 9 2 ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " …"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.774,
            0.885,
            0.828
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\bar { \\pi } \\approx 3 . 1 4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and also "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\pi \\approx { \\frac { 2 2 } { 7 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , March 14 (written "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 - 1 4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " in North America) is celebrated each year as "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Pi Day",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", and 22 July (written ‘22-7’ in"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
